Research Highlights:
For first time magnetic bio-MOFs were synthesized with porous-layer open morphology.   
The effects of ultrasonic irradiation parameters on morphology of magnetic bio-MOFs were investigated.   
The impacts of the magnetic bio-MOF on the development of the promastigote and amastigote stages of Leishmania major were studied.   
We have explored the impacts of the magnetic bio-MOFs on the treatment of the cutaneous leishmaniasis in the murine model among the BALB/c mice.
